#: ui/ui.glade:54
msgid ""
"This application is developed and maintained by the ParsLinux team to "
"facilitate Nvidia graphics driver installation. The drivers are sourced from "
"official ParsLinux and Nvidia repositories.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Driver Source and Usage</b>\n"
"While this is an official ParsLinux application, the graphics drivers "
"themselves are developed by Nvidia Corporation. ParsLinux provides this "
"installation tool as a convenience for our users, but the drivers remain the "
"intellectual property of Nvidia Corporation.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Disclaimer:</b>\n"
"Please note that while we strive to ensure a smooth installation process, "
"ParsLinux cannot guarantee the performance or compatibility of Nvidia "
"drivers with all hardware configurations. Users install these drivers at "
"their own discretion and risk.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Issue Reporting:</b>\n"
"Feel free to report any issues or concerns via our GitHub repository: <a "
"href=\"https://github.com/parslinux/parslinux-nvidia-installer\"> ParsLinux "
"GitHub </a>"
msgstr ""

